# SSOT.md — <Site Name>

> The single source of truth for this site's facts. Agents read it and propose changes; a person
> edits it. Fill in each section; delete a section that does not apply rather than leaving
> placeholders.

---

## 1. Purpose and audience

- What the site is for, in one sentence: <…>
- Who it is for, and what each audience should do next (the calls to action): <…>
- Owner of content decisions: <name or role>

## 2. Routes

| Route | Purpose | Indexable | Languages | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `/` | Home | yes | <en> | |
| `/about` | About the company | yes | <en> | |
| `/contact` | Contact form | yes | <en> | form: §6 |
| `/privacy` | Privacy notice | yes | <en> | linked from the footer and any consent banner |

A page that is deliberately not indexable (a thank-you page) is listed here with "no" and in
`sitemapExclude` in `scripts/check/site.config.json`.

